# ==============================================================================
# NakaSetu Environment Configuration (100% Free Tier Services Only)
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to '.env' for local development or add these keys to your
# hosting provider's Environment Variables dashboard (Vercel / Render / Netlify).
#
# NOTE: All keys listed below have generous permanent FREE tiers (no credit card
# required for basic usage).

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Google Gemini AI API (Required for AI features, dispatch notes & insights)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Free Tier: Google AI Studio provides 10-15 RPM free of charge forever without credit card.
# Get your free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=""
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Application Base URL
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used for metadata, canonical URLs, and webhook callbacks.
# Local: http://localhost:3000
# Production: https://your-nakasetu-project.vercel.app or onrender.com
VITE_APP_URL=""
APP_URL=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Optional Free Geolocation & Map Services (Free Tiers)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenStreetMap / Nominatim: 100% Free & Open Source (No API key required by default).
# If using Mapbox (Free tier: 50,000 monthly map loads free): https://account.mapbox.com/
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=""

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Optional Free SMS / IVR Notification Gateways (Free Tiers / Sandboxes)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Twilio Sandbox (Free trial credit): https://www.twilio.com/try-twilio
VITE_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=""
VITE_TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=""
VITE_TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=""
